{"pages":[{"h":792,"segs":[["SOME",150.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,256.01999999999998,116.00059999999996,80,false],["TIME",150.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,240.10000000000002,176.00059999999996,80,false],["ASK",150.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,187.46000000000001,194.10059999999999,20,false],["SOMETIME.",163.70000000000002,194.03179999999998,246.62640000000002,215.71179999999993,16,false],["A BRIEF OVERVIEW",251.56,194.03179999999998,390.9984,215.71179999999993,16,false],["Every person is on a spiritual",219.94540000000001,250.64469999999983,330.23140000000001,263.04669999999987,9,false],["journey. Life has been viewed as a",219.94540000000001,263.64469999999983,347.22250000000008,276.04669999999987,9,false],["journey by all cultures throughout",219.94540000000001,276.64469999999994,349.30150000000003,289.04669999999999,9,false],["history. It's a universal concept.",219.94540000000001,289.6447,340.20159999999998,302.04669999999999,9,false],["During this cojourner experience",443.74550000000005,250.64469999999983,569.94260000000008,263.04669999999987,9,false],["you will be asking friends...",443.74550000000005,263.64469999999983,545.73170000000005,276.04669999999987,9,false],["\"Sometime, I'd like to hear about",443.74550000000005,276.64469999999994,567.60260000000005,289.04669999999999,9,false],["your spiritual journey...Would you",443.74550000000005,289.6447,572.05670000000009,302.04669999999999,9,false],["be up for that?\" And during that",443.74550000000005,302.6447,563.33570000000009,315.04669999999999,9,false],["conversation (or in a next one), ask",443.74550000000005,315.6447,575.79260000000011,328.04669999999999,9,false],["if you can meet to hear his or her story. It's so simple.",370.20000000000005,328.6447,569.53020000000015,341.04669999999999,9,false],["Yet so rewarding.",370.20000000000005,341.6447,435.64800000000002,354.04669999999999,9,false],["Joining others in their spiritual",219.94540000000001,315.6447,339.44650000000001,328.04669999999999,9,false],["and life journey is one of the world's greatest needs",146.40000000000001,328.6447,339.19620000000009,341.04669999999999,9,false],["and greatest privileges. Perhaps you've had the",146.40000000000001,341.6447,322.8882000000001,354.04669999999999,9,false],["privilege of participating in a friend's life journey",146.40000000000001,354.6447,332.49930000000006,367.04669999999999,9,false],["as Jesus was transforming his or her life. It's a truly",146.40000000000001,367.6447,340.92420000000004,380.04669999999999,9,false],["remarkable experience.",146.40000000000001,380.6447,235.89510000000001,393.04669999999999,9,false],["SomeTime | Ask. Explore. Discover.",370.20000000000005,367.31170000000003,519.10320000000013,380.69470000000001,9,false],["\"You can't guess where people are at spiritually. You",370.20000000000005,380.6447,566.04720000000009,393.04669999999999,9,false],["have to discover it.\"",370.20000000000005,393.6447,444.27810000000005,406.04669999999999,9,false],["Unfortunately, even though many of us desire to",146.40000000000001,406.6447,327.75720000000007,419.04669999999999,9,false],["\"cojourn\" in the spiritual journeys of our friends,",146.40000000000001,419.6447,330.6273000000001,432.04669999999999,9,false],["insecurity, fear, and not knowing where to start often",146.40000000000001,432.6447,346.53930000000014,445.04669999999999,9,false],["prevent us. But there is a way forward. It's called",146.40000000000001,445.6447,329.13420000000008,458.04669999999999,9,false],["\"SomeTime.\"",146.40000000000001,458.6447,197.12400000000002,471.04669999999999,9,false],["SOME TIME 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999991,57.071200000000005,560.72839999999997,9,false],["SomeTime is a cojourner",219.94540000000001,484.6447,315.32740000000001,497.04669999999999,9,false],["experience—a time dedicated to",219.94540000000001,497.6447,340.98460000000011,510.04669999999999,9,false],["exploring the spiritual backstories",219.94540000000001,510.6447,350.47059999999999,523.04669999999999,9,false],["of our friends. Simply put, it's",219.94540000000001,523.64470000000006,331.94860000000006,536.04669999999999,9,false],["about taking interest in others. It's",219.94540000000001,536.64470000000006,350.71360000000004,549.04669999999999,9,false],["about asking questions. It's about",219.94540000000001,549.64470000000006,346.54660000000001,562.04669999999999,9,false],["seeking to understand the faith journeys of friends.",146.40000000000001,562.64470000000006,339.38520000000005,575.04669999999999,9,false],["SomeTime is designed to help get past some common",146.40000000000001,588.64470000000006,345.72090000000009,601.04669999999999,9,false],["obstacles through a few simple, doable steps. And",146.40000000000001,601.64470000000006,333.07620000000009,614.04669999999999,9,false],["it seeks to provide easy connections to the gospel",146.40000000000001,614.64470000000006,331.54620000000006,627.04669999999999,9,false],["through planned conversations.",146.40000000000001,627.64470000000006,266.71109999999999,640.04669999999999,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612}]}